{"schema_version": 1, "unit_id": "tag:0BA9:proof", "parent_tag": "04MS", "chapter": "properties", "node_kind": "proof", "risk_level": "R3", "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_text": "This follows from Lemma <REF_0001> for example.\n", "source_status": "CURRENT", "placeholders": {"REF_0001": "\\ref{lemma-codimension-local-ring}"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{proof}\n", "suffix": "\\end{proof}"}, "source_text_hash": "sha256:a5ea54407f1e1f7d0747e8c27b0090ce556dc1fb0f7e8a4e35f88a2af45f1a1a", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:0f0504412dad5d5d1c947a9100d793230ecbc385e2af92b8b1924e96a69c3c73", "source_math_hash": "sha256:44136fa355b3678a1146ad16f7e8649e94fb4fc21fe77e8310c060f61caaff8a"}
{"schema_version": 1, "unit_id": "tag:0AAX:statement", "parent_tag": "04MS", "chapter": "properties", "node_kind": "lemma", "risk_level": "R3", "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_text": "A locally Noetherian scheme of dimension <MATH_0001> is a disjoint\nunion of spectra of Artinian local rings.\n", "source_status": "CURRENT", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$0$"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{lemma}\n\\label{lemma-locally-Noetherian-dimension-0}\n", "suffix": "\\end{lemma}"}, "source_text_hash": "sha256:1975d958f63a5465c1a91b73e1377f58a04d2b9e0344060ea55404024b049619", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:e6208075c2df7b0cb1dfab1b90836da6389531c1178b13c4245ade892ab537ea", "source_math_hash": "sha256:3fa23b0b63474bb791fe77aa109d46b4825e3d9a88d0b113ae1aff7badeef846"}
{"schema_version": 1, "unit_id": "tag:0AAX:proof", "parent_tag": "04MS", "chapter": "properties", "node_kind": "proof", "risk_level": "R3", "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_text": "A Noetherian ring of dimension <MATH_0001> is a finite product of Artinian local\nrings, see\nAlgebra, Proposition <REF_0001>.\nHence an affine open of a locally Noetherian scheme <MATH_0002> of dimension\n<MATH_0003> has discrete underlying topological space. This implies that\nthe topology on <MATH_0004> is discrete. The lemma follows easily from these\nremarks.\n", "source_status": "CURRENT", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$0$", "REF_0001": "\\ref{algebra-proposition-dimension-zero-ring}", "MATH_0002": "$X$", "MATH_0003": "$0$", "MATH_0004": "$X$"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{proof}\n", "suffix": "\\end{proof}"}, "source_text_hash": "sha256:b12b7eb4ba5a588407bb4e80450a4dda3e4f7f408f81dd0751be54e4e6e0841c", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:a5ea4b7429b52109fd89a62d21283d782dd82c695893d9a685192bafbac0c36c", "source_math_hash": "sha256:a7d0e52e74d41fe4773a1071b302cd521b72eb7efe072d868a7bc5dcd40e51ea"}
{"schema_version": 1, "unit_id": "tag:0CKV:statement", "parent_tag": "04MS", "chapter": "properties", "node_kind": "lemma", "risk_level": "R3", "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_text": "<LOCKED_0001>\nLet <MATH_0001> be a scheme of dimension zero. The following are equivalent\n<STRUCT_0001>\n<STRUCT_0002> <MATH_0002> is quasi-separated,\n<STRUCT_0003> <MATH_0003> is separated,\n<STRUCT_0004> <MATH_0004> is Hausdorff,\n<STRUCT_0005> every affine open is closed.\n<STRUCT_0006>\nIn this case the connected components of <MATH_0005> are points and every\nquasi-compact open of <MATH_0006> is affine. In particular, if <MATH_0007>\nis quasi-compact, then <MATH_0008> is affine.\n", "source_status": "CURRENT", "placeholders": {"LOCKED_0001": "\\begin{reference}\nEmail from Ofer Gabber dated June 4, 2016\n\\end{reference}", "MATH_0001": "$X$", "STRUCT_0001": "\\begin{enumerate}", "STRUCT_0002": "\\item", "MATH_0002": "$X$", "STRUCT_0003": "\\item", "MATH_0003": "$X$", "STRUCT_0004": "\\item", "MATH_0004": "$X$", "STRUCT_0005": "\\item", "STRUCT_0006": "\\end{enumerate}", "MATH_0005": "$X$", "MATH_0006": "$X$", "MATH_0007": "$X$", "MATH_0008": "$X$"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{lemma}\n\\label{lemma-dimension-zero}\n", "suffix": "\\end{lemma}"}, "source_text_hash": "sha256:57e67b00be7473be746df808a903f71ea70c1ce51a1b36fb4b73df71b234e0b2", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:0dae7679b532031cc6259704e9e621ad0ce677a3496e8fcaf483ea007717c1cf", "source_math_hash": "sha256:be9b425ca9d0c8eb9f7b78a12628183ee20f585e8c5cb85434822bf6c0154a7f"}
